<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;
$a and $b should not be understood as stand-ins for "anything"
&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
True. I very consciously chose the scalars &lt;c&gt;$a&lt;/c&gt; and &lt;c&gt;$b&lt;/c&gt;.  In fact, I had originally started to write &lt;c&gt;return A ? A : B;&lt;/c&gt; but realized that that would not be sufficient, nor would it be necessary for the point (i.e. the OP's problem).
